# Enquiry form — Resend (free tier is enough; no other paid service).
# The site delivers nothing until RESEND_API_KEY is set on Vercel.
# A missing key does not crash the page: the form shows the phone and email fallback.
#
# 1. Create a Resend account: https://resend.com
# 2. Create an API key: https://resend.com/api-keys
# 3. Verify webservicesforbusiness.com: https://resend.com/domains
#    Add the DNS records Resend shows (DKIM / SPF). Do not replace existing MX
#    records, or mail to support@ will stop arriving.
# 4. Vercel → project webservicesforbusiness → Settings → Environment Variables
#    Add RESEND_API_KEY for Production (and Preview if you want the form there).
#    Redeploy after saving. The key is not stored in this repository.

RESEND_API_KEY=

# Optional. Use this if the verified sender is not the default
# Web Services for Business <support@webservicesforbusiness.com>
# RESEND_FROM=Web Services for Business <support@webservicesforbusiness.com>
